                  * name: it is the only refusal here that means somebody knows
                  * the account exists.  (A malformed or wrong-length proof
                  * lands here too; it was never a separate answer on the wire.)
                  scram.refuse.reason = 'wrong password'
                  goto scram.bad.cred
